# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 1:1
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. A wide rough clay mortar bowl seen slightly from above, filled with a thick pale green paste, a long wooden pestle resting against its rim. Beside it a small bowl of puffed rice and two tiny dishes holding peanuts and sesame seeds, a few loose green tea leaves scattered on a plain wooden table. Soft monochrome ink with a faint wash of jade green in the paste, wet brush washes, generous negative space, calm and uncluttered. No text, no lettering.
